  m_Text: 'Dear Delilah,


    Sky is closer in Poppy Town.

    Ambrosia for us.

    Vines
    nourish our thirst.

    An ethereal feast.


    My mind, quiet.

    Everyone,
    waiting.


    Mary


    Mary'
